    <!-- ===== WHY VISIT ===== -->
    <section class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-28">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50 p-6">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 mb-4 text-lg font-bold">1</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Authentic Tibetan Culture</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Experience genuine Tibetan Buddhist traditions without needing a Tibet permit. Morning chanting at Songzanlin Monastery, prayer flag ceremonies, and centuries-old architecture.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50 p-6">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-50 text-sky-600 mb-4 text-lg font-bold">2</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Dramatic Landscapes</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">From 6,740m snow peaks to deep gorges, alpine lakes to vast grasslands. Shangri-La packs more geographic diversity into one prefecture than most countries.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50 p-6">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 mb-4 text-lg font-bold">3</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Accessible Adventure</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Modern expressway from Lijiang, direct flights from major Chinese cities. World-class trekking, photography, and cultural immersion without the logistical complexity of remote Tibet.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ===== SHANGRI-LA VS TIBET ===== -->
    <section id="vs-tibet" class="bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-28">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mb-14">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-emerald-600">Comparison</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Shangri-La vs Tibet</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Many travelers wonder: can Shangri-La replace Tibet? Here's an honest side-by-side comparison so you can decide which fits your trip.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
                <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-slate-600 w-[20%]">Aspect</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-emerald-700 w-[33%]">Shangri-La</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-slate-600 w-[33%]">Tibet (TAR)</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-slate-600 w-[14%]">Winner</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
              {vsTibet.map(row => (
                <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors">
                  <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-slate-700">{row.aspect}</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-500">{row.shangriLa}</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-500">{row.tibet}</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-3">
                    {row.winner === 'shangri-la' ? (
                      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">Shangri-La</span>
                    ) : row.winner === 'tibet' ? (
                      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-sky-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-sky-700">Tibet</span>
                    ) : (
                      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700">Depends</span>
                    )}
                  </td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-400"><strong>Bottom line:</strong> Shangri-La wins on accessibility, cost, and freedom. Tibet wins on scale and spiritual depth. If you want Tibetan culture without the logistical headache, Shangri-La is your answer. If Tibet is a lifelong dream and you're okay with a guided tour, go for it — or do both.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- ===== ATTRACTIONS ===== -->
    <section id="explore" class="bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-28">
