            <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Shangri-La sits at 3,160m. Most visitors adapt in 24-48 hours. Here is what to expect and how to prepare.</p>

            <div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4">
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Mild symptoms (normal)</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Headache, shortness of breath when walking uphill, fatigue, mild insomnia. These are normal and usually resolve within a day.</p>
